Criterion 5: no file under lib/ outside context_extensions.dart changed

The criterion is written as 'git diff --name-only origin/main -- lib/'.
That form only reads true from the feature branch before origin/main moves.
origin/main advanced twice while this was in flight (#199 touched the two
tasks screens), so the honest form is the diff of the fix commit itself
and the diff against its own parent.

$ git show --stat --name-only 134038d
    `Navigator.of(this).push(MaterialPageRoute(...))` routes in a go_router app
    and had no production caller: `navigateTo` was reached only by its own test,
    `navigateToReplacement` and `pop` by nothing at all.
    
    `pop` was the sharp edge. It shares its name and its receiver with
    go_router's `GoRouterHelper.pop`, so any file importing both got
    `ambiguous_extension_member_access` on `context.pop()`.
    
    The two tests for the removed members are replaced by one that imports both
    `package:go_router` and `context_extensions.dart` and calls `context.pop()`,
    so re-adding a `pop` member breaks compilation instead of an adopter's build.
    Docs that showed the removed helpers now show the routing API.
    
    Refs koniz-dev/flutter-starter#178

docs/api/examples/api-integration.md
docs/api/examples/common-patterns.md
docs/guides/features/common-tasks.md
lib/shared/extensions/context_extensions.dart
test/shared/extensions/context_extensions_test.dart

$ git diff --name-only 4a5f8f2..HEAD -- lib/
lib/shared/extensions/context_extensions.dart
  -> exactly one path

$ git diff --name-only 4a5f8f2..HEAD
docs/api/examples/api-integration.md
docs/api/examples/common-patterns.md
docs/guides/features/common-tasks.md
lib/shared/extensions/context_extensions.dart
test/shared/extensions/context_extensions_test.dart

Everything outside lib/ is the test file for the removed members plus the
three docs snippets that documented them.

For completeness, the pre-merge check run on the feature branch before
origin/main moved:
  $ git diff --name-only origin/main -- lib/
  lib/shared/extensions/context_extensions.dart
